{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s861da6f45add8438","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-fbcdf7f16f19ec011cd5","text":"この湯気、すごく強烈だね。まるでバリアみたいで、水面に近づくこともできないひら……","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-868656f686ccca6396b3","text":"でも、お風呂に入るのを諦めない——逆風に立ち向かって飛ぶ蝶、それこそが僕ひら！","speaker":""}]}
